WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.057
Poori library ek screen par: kaun andar hai, kiski fees baaki hai, kya dhyaan maangta hai.

00:00:06.157 --> 00:00:12.070
Seat map har seat dikhata hai, shift ke hisaab se, aur kaun si khaali hai.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:18.083
Fee plans ek baar set karein, jaise Monthly 30 din ke liye.

00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:24.393
Students aapki Library ID se judte hain. Aap seat, shift, plan chunkar approve karte hain.

00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:30.403
Har student, unki membership aur baaki fees, ek list mein.

00:00:30.503 --> 00:00:36.412
Cash ya UPI fees darj karein. Receipt student ke app mein dikhti hai.

00:00:36.512 --> 00:00:42.412
Aaj kaun library mein hai dekhein. Students sirf andar se punch in kar sakte hain.

00:00:42.512 --> 00:00:48.422
Monthly reports mein income, kharcha aur munafa dikhta hai.

00:00:48.522 --> 00:00:55.108
Owners password ke saath authenticator code se sign in karte hain. Recovery codes sambhal kar rakhein.
